	<string id="video_settings_desc_70">
		<text>Sets the NVIDIA DLSS internal render scale. DLAA renders at native resolution. Quality, Balanced, Performance and Ultra Performance use progressively lower internal resolutions to gain FPS. Applying this setting recreates video resources.</text>
